# Allowlist, deliberately. This working directory also holds extracted vendor
# rootfs dumps, a partial debootstrap backup and multi-hundred-MB build
# artifacts, none of which may be published. Denying by pattern kept letting
# those through, so nothing is tracked unless it is named here.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

!gateway/
!gateway/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!doc/
!doc/**

# Build outputs, even under an allowed directory.
gateway/**/__pycache__/
gateway/**/*.pyc
